    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: "Bro, that\u2019s exactly why you\u2019re just a shipper. No speed, no
      soul. Just a slow guy on a slow bike... Ok that's kinda harsh, my bad."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Just give me the stuff so I can leave.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: Alright here it is, deliver it safe and sound for me, take care!
